## 📈 LEARNING & IMPROVEMENT

### **Pattern Recognition**
```
The system learns from:
✅ User accepts generated component without changes
✅ User requests similar components with same context
✅ User provides positive feedback

The system adapts when:
❌ User requests multiple modifications
❌ User rejects component styling/functionality  
❌ User provides negative feedback
```

